          %p
          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              %strong (on notation)
              %br/
              Contrary to most references, Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FiberwiseMappingSpace"}
              is intentionally not using a subsript “
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mrow
                      %mi B
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {}_B
              ” in the notation for the fiberwise mapping space: This is because “
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Map
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo ,
                    %mi A
                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mi B
