          %p
          #FiberwiseMappingSpaceBetweenTrivialFibrations.num_remark
            %h6 Example
            %p
              %strong (fiberwise mapping space between trivial fibrations)
              %br/
              The fiberwise mapping space (Def.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FiberwiseMappingSpace"}
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:TrivialFibration"} (5)
              is the trivial fibration with fiber the ordinary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact-open+topology"} mapping space
              between the fibers:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Map
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                    %msubsup
                      %mi p
